        ["And thou art the cattle upon which I prey!" *"Who sent thee to destroy Vasculio? Was it those rotting worms of Moonshade?" *"I know it was! Soon I shall have my vengeance for what they have done to me!" *"Who sent thee? Filbercio?! Mortegro?! Gustacio?! Torrissio?!"];
